			<Description xml:space="preserve">Goto manual with one click (opens in browser)</Description>
			<Tags>manual,documentation,manual integration,reference search,manual search,function reference,google,google stackoverflow,google search,stackoverflow search,php,php manual,php documentation,css,css manual,css documentation,python,python manual,python documentation,Golang,Golang Manual,Golang Documentation,C++,C++ Manual,C++ Documentation,CPP,CPP Manual,CPP Documentation,Rust,Rust Manual,Rust Documentation,Perl,Perl Manual,Perl Documentation,R,R Manual,R Documentation,Swift,Swift Manual,Swift Documentation,Julia,Julia Manual,Julia Documentation,Matlab,Matlab Manual,Matlab Documentation,MySQL,MySQL Manual,MySQL Documentation,MariaDB,Mariadb Manual,Mariadb Documentation</Tags>
			<Categories>Programming Languages,Other</Categories>
